Package: predglmm
Title: Marginal Predictions for Generalized Linear Mixed Models
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Karl Oskar", "Ekvall", , "k.o.ekvall@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes marginal predictions (expected values on the response scale)
    for generalized linear mixed models fitted with 'lme4' or 'glmmTMB'.
    Integrates over the random effects distribution using analytical formulas
    when available or Gaussian-Hermite quadrature
    for custom link functions.
